{"ID":"20240314091901-go9rv23","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091901-go9rv23","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091901-go9rv23\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165919-7jzpwqc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165919-ydgu2k6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:71,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165919-ydgu2k6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:39,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:39\u0026#125;","title":"【茯苓泽泻汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165919-7jzpwqc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-7jzpwqc","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃反，吐而渴，欲饮水者，茯苓泽泻汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-c93gtfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-c93gtfp","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓泽泻汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-8je2elb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-8je2elb","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓半斤泽泻四两甘草桂枝各二两白术三两生姜四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-91ftsab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-91ftsab","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，以水一斗，煑取三升，内泽泻再煑取二升半，温服八合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-k73q97j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-k73q97j","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你说老师，怎么这么多胃反啊，刚刚那个也是胃反。就是胃在造反。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-dps1jup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-dps1jup","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种呢，胃里面本来就有留饮在里面的人，就会有这种现象："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃反"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，恶心哪，呕吐啊，也是朝食暮吐啊。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吐而渴，欲饮水者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。吐掉以后口渴，想喝水的哦，这种的朝食暮吐，就是胃里面有停饮在里面。这个吐掉的时候哦，津液吐掉了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会用到这个茯苓泽泻汤，代表说这个水呢不单单是在胃里面，而是在胃的周围网膜上面都是水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只是停在胃里面的时候，小半夏汤就可以去掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。它不单单是在胃里面，所以你吐掉了以后呢，它会口渴，会想喝水，喝了还是恶心，因为水不在胃里面而在胃的周围。所以这个是我们需要大剂一点的处方，而不单单是半夏可以解决的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-wh78kil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-wh78kil","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，大家看这个处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-hvj6duw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-hvj6duw","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看，这个甘草，就是用在胃里面对不对？因为恶心呕吐胃反嘛，甘草下去就把食物的毒素分解掉。那我们知道它（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）是在胃的周围，胃的周围就是脾嘛，脾脏在这边，这个水呢我们用白术、茯苓去。大家注意看，我们处方的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓五钱，泽泻四钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草、桂枝二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜四片"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般我们要利用生姜去止呕的时候，生姜就要加重，生姜又没有毒对不对？你平常煮菜都用生姜对不对，所以不用担心。那白术和茯苓呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术的剂量会比茯苓少，是因为我们要把水排掉。白术是收敛湿，收起来以后，茯苓把它排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。泽泻呢，在胃的上方的水，就是用泽泻来排它。这就是它的处方的方义。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-8vrquf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-8vrquf7","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个胃反呢，因为里面是虚寒的，桂枝是壮心阳，它能够很热，所以会用桂枝。那这个处方煮的时候，你用六碗水煮成两碗，就可以了哦。那这个处方用得是蛮多的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-piv2432","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-piv2432","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家看到这个处方以后哦，跟小半夏汤的差异...你如果哪一天你碰到一个病人，你说老师我这个病人很多的症状都很接近哦，我搞不清楚。你这个病人在那边呕吐，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他吐出来，只要是有口渴，我们不用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我不是一直在跟大家讲嘛，因为半夏很强啊，半夏一下去整个人不渴也渴了，好不好。那这个病人只要有渴，就不要用半夏。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以说恶心呢，在这里看不到半夏，为什么？因为病人渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。已经口渴了想喝水了，你还在给他吃半夏？这样了解我的意思吧？所以你要离婚很简单啦，我要离婚很简单，（给爱人治病）处方改一下就好了，就发疯了，人就会疯了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-0mvqzsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-0mvqzsn","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240410160418-fvmoqxc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-hshaqe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-hshaqe0","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那当你掌握到这个原则以后，如果有实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有东西堵在胃里面造成的胃反，大黄甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。胃旁边的水造成的胃反...胃反就是朝食暮吐，吃东西下去食物就吐掉，那个食物没有办法在胃里面呆很久，这种处方就是因为那个湿绕着胃的一圈，在中膈这边。你要知道，桂枝都是行阳的。所以我们把肚脐以下，肚脐在这边（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐以上呢是阳，这个部分靠的是什么？桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐以下呢是阴，靠的是什么？白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以胃在肚脐以上，所以我们要行阳气，有没有？它就会回来。这就是为什么选择桂枝的原因就在这里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165919-ydgu2k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165919-ydgu2k6","updated":"20240422165919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以方子你如果能够了解处方的时候哦，这设计这个处方很自然就会形成这个处方了哦。"}]}]}